        "collapsible_tab_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_by_default": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "Overview",
            "tab_content": "<p>Valuable addition to any blemish-focused skincare line, offering lightweight hydration while addressing the needs of acne-prone skin.</p><p>Its balanced formula and natural ingredient profile make it an ideal product for brands targeting both teenage and adult consumers seeking gentle yet effective blemish care.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_by_default": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "Description",
            "tab_content": "<p>This lightweight moisturiser is designed to hydrate, soothe, and support blemish-prone skin without feeling heavy or clogging pores.</p><p>Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid and natural polysaccharides, it helps maintain optimal moisture levels while promoting a smoother, clearer-looking complexion.</p><p>Argan Oil and Sodium PCA support skin hydration and softness, while an antioxidant complex featuring Vitamin C, Mate Leaf, Iceland Moss, and Juniper Callus extracts helps protect and calm the skin.</p><p>The fast-absorbing formula leaves the skin feeling balanced, comfortable, and refreshed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_by_default": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "tab_content": "<p>Apply a pea-sized amount to clean skin on the face and neck.</p><ul><li>Gently massage until fully absorbed.</li></ul><p>Use morning and evening.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "Use for",
            "tab_content": "<ul><li><strong>Skin Concerns:</strong> Blemishes, Dehydrated Skin</li><li><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Blemish-Prone Skin</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "Key Active Ingredients",
            "tab_content": "<p>Argan Oil, Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium PCA, Mate Leaf Extract, Iceland Moss Extract, Juniper Callus Extract</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "Ingredients (INCI)",
            "tab_content": "<p>Aqua/Water, Glycerin, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil, Pentylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-6 Stearate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cellulose, Sodium PCA, Isoamyl Laurate, Zinc PCA, Aroma/Fragrance, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Propanediol, Polyglyceryl-6 Behenate, Alcohol, Xanthan Gum, Ilex Paraguariensis (Mate) Leaf Extract, Palmitic Acid, Stearic Acid, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Tocopherol, Potassium Hydroxide, Sodium Phytate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Cetraria Islandica (Iceland Moss) Extract, Usnea Barbata (Lichen) Extract, Rhamnose, Juniperus Communis (Juniper) Callus Extract, CI 77007 (Ultramarines), Glucose, Glucuronic Acid, Silica, Kaolin, Maltodextrin, CI 75815 (Chlorophyllin Copper Complex), Linalool, Linalyl Acetate, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia Peel Oil, Citral, Limonene, Juniperus Virginiana Oil, Citronellol, Pinene</p>"
          }
        },
